  [allowed] probes/tape/bios_probe_casin.py — 🔧 ARCHIVED, WAS SILENTLY WRONG, FIXED 2026-08-31 (D-CASINSETTLE). Re-running it printed BOTH candidates static -- the REFUTATION of its own documented finding (tape/docs/tape-internals.md:66) -- and exited 0. The settle after motor-on was ~119 ms; openMSX's player needs ~0.5 s before signal reaches the port. Widened to ~0.9 s and taught to REFUSE (rc=2) when neither candidate moves. Now reproduces the finding exactly: PPI-B static, R14 23 transitions, 127/256 high.
